<Layout title="About the demo"><article class="prose"><h1>Know what’s known.</h1><p>Elsewhere helps you find a place for a different workday in Dubai. This starter uses eight fictional venue concepts and illustrative stock photographs. None is a recommendation or verified real-world listing.</p><h2>Reading the evidence</h2><p>Each amenity shows a value and an evidence state. The words carry the meaning; the mark and tone only reinforce it.</p><dl class="legend"><div><dt><span class="pill" data-tone="positive">Yes · Verified</span></dt><dd>Independently observed, with a source and date, within the last 90 days. The only state that passes a “Verified” filter.</dd></div><div><dt><span class="pill" data-tone="negative">No · Verified</span></dt><dd>Checked and absent.</dd></div><div><dt><span class="pill" data-tone="caution">Yes · Reported</span></dt><dd>A claim, for example from the venue, that nobody has independently checked.</dd></div><div><dt><span class="pill" data-tone="caution">Yes · Needs recheck</span></dt><dd>A verification older than 90 days, or with a future date. It no longer counts as verified.</dd></div><div><dt><span class="pill" data-tone="caution">Conflicting reports</span></dt><dd>Sources disagree, so no positive claim is made.</dd></div><div><dt><span class="pill" data-tone="unknown">Not checked</span></dt><dd>No reliable information yet.</dd></div></dl><p>Wi-Fi availability says nothing about speed. Work modes are editorial fit suggestions, not proof of amenities. Step-free access is recorded separately and is never inferred from photographs. There is no venue-wide “verified” badge.</p><h2>Your saved places</h2><p>Saved place IDs stay in local storage on this browser. They do not sync across devices. The Saved screen compares the evidence for your shortlist side by side. Clearing browser data removes them. If storage is blocked, saves last only for the current page session. No analytics or account service is included.</p><h2>Photo credits</h2><p>Illustrative images are provided by Unsplash under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license">Unsplash License</a>. They do not depict the fictional venues or establish any venue fact.</p><ul>{['photo-1501339847302-ac426a4a7cbb','photo-1442512595331-e89e73853f31','photo-1497366811353-6870744d04b2','photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4'].map(id=><li><a href={`https://images.unsplash.com/${id}`}>{id}</a></li>)}</ul></article></Layout>
